# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in values. `.env.local` is gitignored at the repo root.
# Do not commit real keys. Do not put keys in Cursor cloud agent environments.
#
# Chapter TTS generate (Phase 3+ on a trusted laptop):
#   ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=your_key_here
#   make generate-chapter-audio UNIT=chapter-observer-patterns-front-matter-introduction DRY_RUN=1
#   make generate-chapter-audio UNIT=… MOCK=1          # offline artifact practice (no API)
#   make generate-chapter-audio UNIT=… REAL=1          # real ElevenLabs call (needs key + real voice id)
#
# Default without MOCK/REAL is dry-run (no spend). Listen UI needs no enable env var — it
# appears only for chapters with available installed audio.
#
# Ordinary plan/list/validate targets do not need this variable.

# ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=
